	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Spring has come to Tenkyo, and the season of Persica is upon us once again.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The palace courtyard is resplendent with peach blossoms in full bloom.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The peach trees sure are as pretty as a picture.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Today's Persica Blossom Festival is gonna be one to remember!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Akari flashes me a smile so breathtakingly lovely that it puts all the Persica to shame.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I spent ages picking out my yukata, so look forward to that, mmkay?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I can't wait.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I've experienced the Persica Blossom Festival more times than I can remember.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"But in all my undying existence, I've never been as excited for it as I am today.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"After all, this is the first time I will be able to attend the festival with Akari on my arm.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"To still my restless heart, I begin unthinkingly arranging the Persica branches in the vase in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like the manager taught you well.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A simple arrangement like this is nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Akari plucks a lone flower and brings it up to her nose.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ehehee, that's a nice fragrance.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"She truly is living up to her title of Empre",
{"ruby", text="Peach Blossom"},
"ss Touka.   ",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Mh.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"A faint pain lances across the tip of my finger.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Looking down, I spot a tiny scratch oozing a drop of blood.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I must've nicked my finger on the branch.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's nothing. It'll close soon enough.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"With this body of mine, I'm able to survive even mortal wounds.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"A scratch like this should take no time at all to─",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It sure is taking its time to heal.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sure is. What gives?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The two of us stare at my finger for over a minute, but the wound still does not close.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Before, you would've healed that in the blink of an eye.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You think your powers might be getting weaker 'cause Mitsurugi isn't around anymore?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That would make sense...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Watching the blood well up from my fingertip, I think back to what transpired in Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"The divine powers of “He who cuts down all calamity befalling the Empire” must have been left behind with him in that desolate world.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't let it bother you. Even if you're not Ame no Mitsurugi, you'll always be my most treasured vassal and the love of my life.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Akari squeezes my hand reassuringly.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I doubt there's another tool in this wide world so blessed as to serve a lord like you.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I squeeze her hand back and pull her into a tight embrace.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"To think that despite being shapen as a mere tool, I am capable of experiencing such warmth, such happiness─",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"In my arms, Akari gently leans her head against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"But when I look down to meet her eyes, I notice a slight pout on her lips.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How many times do I have to tell you? Stop calling yourself a tool.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Grinning to myself, I apologize as I stroke Akari's hair.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you say to asking Kotone to give you a lookover?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She was present in the audience just now, so she should still be in the palace.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, let's ask her.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I pull out my phone and send Kotone a brief text message.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Upon placing her hands on my body, Kotone furrows her brow in concentration.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can you figure anything out?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It does appear as though your magicks have weakened slightly.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe it is indeed because Mitsurugi-sama is no longer present within you.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If Soujin-sama's body might be likened to a vessel for spellforce, it would be as though it has sprung an irreparable leak...”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does that mean my power as Ame no Mitsurugi will continue to grow weaker?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is a definite possibility.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“S-Soujin's not gonna disappear, is he?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please rest assured. That will certainly not happen.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank goodness...”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Akari heaves a sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I were to disappear, Tenkyo just might get buried in peach petals again.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, shut it, you.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please do refrain from doing anything reckless, all right?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your body is likely not as invincible as it once was.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please think of yourself not as Ame no Mitsurugi, but as an ordinary warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I'll be careful.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I can't make any promises if Akari ever gets in any danger.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I should have expected no less...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Kotone mutters with an exasperated grimace.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, thanks for your help.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, no, I am simply glad to have been of service.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well then, I shall be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, any plans for the Persica Blossom Festival?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Naturally, I will be partaking in the festivities!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Heheheh, no street stall will be safe from my stomach this year!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah? Have fun with that.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I certainly shall! My pride as the Exalt-Priestess demands it!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Kotone bows to us before energetically bounding out of the palace.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"With her departure, the hall is silent once more, save for the slight susurrus of the spring breeze.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ehehee, Kotone's as lively as ever.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Soujin? What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's finally sinking in that I'm no longer Ame no Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"There is no warrior that does not yearn to be strong, and I am certainly no exception.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"But even though I'm now but a mere mortal, it makes me happy to know that Akari and I are one and the same.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"For me, there could be no greater joy than to walk by her side until the end of our days.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you disappointed by that?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, it's the opposite.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Empire probably won't need the Sacred Treasures on the new path it's taking, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Truth be told, I'm pretty happy about it as well.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You won't ever be calling yourself a tool from now on, right?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does it really bother you that much?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So what if it does?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Akari sullenly puffs out her cheeks at me.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"But she soon clears her throat, fixing me with a solemn gaze.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... No, Ame no Mitsurugi. You have my sincere gratitude for your tireless defense of the Empire these past two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You are a true hero of the Empire, and the depth of your fealty shall never be forgotten.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I suppose Ame no Mitsurugi can finally retire in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" certainly have no intentions of hanging up my blade.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Even though there are no more battles to fight, I will never stop being a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone said the same thing, but I also don't wanna see you pulling any more crazy stunts, got it?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Lets grow old together and make so many more happy memories. All right, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Akari strokes my hair as she whispers this in my ear.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"After two thousand years of ceaseless battle, the unconditional warmth of her words, her presence, has finally made my battered body whole again.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Right now, I want nothing more than to convey the overflowing love I'm feeling for this precious girl in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"As I tenderly cup her cheek in my hand, Akari's eyes shimmer with clear understanding of my intent.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...We agreed to go to the festival later today, didn't we?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And you wanted to see me in my yukata, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I do.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to see your yukata, but I don't want to be apart from you for even a second.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, what am I gonna do with you...? Nnmh...”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Akari parts her lips slightly, accepting my kiss.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hah, nnmmh... *smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"But every time I try to separate our lips, she immediately meets them with her own again.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Like a fledgling chick begging to be fed, Akari eagerly kisses me over and over.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"To assuage any anxieties she might have had, I hold her tight to show that I'll never let her go.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnmmh, *smooch, smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Though we've kissed and kissed countless times, my heart still races each time we do.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Today, more than ever, coming together to share our love for each other feels so indescribably precious to me.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, come with me...”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Ushered in by Akari, I enter the room.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Before I get changed into the yukata, I'll take off these clothes I'm wearing now...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Present between us is a mutual understanding that transcends the need for words.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"I gently stroke Akari's cheek.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Just a touch of her pristine skin is enough to set my heart at ease.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"And in the wake of such calm, it overflows with desire for her.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All right, let's get changed and be on our way to the festival.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, let's stay together. Forever and ever.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"We seal that promise of ours with a tender embrace.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I'm sure that even many years from now, Akari and I will think fondly back to our first Persica Blossom Festival spent together as a couple.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Looking forward to that beautiful future of ours, we share the first kiss of the rest of our lives together.",
